      "ordinal": 90,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "F688F5917F679150",
      "text": "¡Pues ya está!\\nDiría que te queda de maravilla, ¿a que sí?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_00_04",
      "hash64": "F688FC917F679D35",
      "text": "¡Gracias por tu visita!\\nEsperamos volver a verte pronto.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_00_05",
      "hash64": "F688FB917F679B82",
      "text": "¿Quieres ponerte lo que llevabas en la cabeza?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_00_06",
      "hash64": "F688FA917F6799CF",
      "text": "¡Vale! A ver, un segundito...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_00_07",
      "hash64": "F688F9917F67981C",
      "text": "¡Vale! Te lo guardo en la Bolsa, entonces.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_00_08",
      "hash64": "F68900917F67A401",
      "text": "No puedes ponerte nada en la cabeza con este\\npeinado, así que te he guardado lo que llevabas\\r\\nen la Bolsa, ¿vale?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_00_10",
      "hash64": "F68572917F647CE0",
      "text": "¡Muy bien! Serán [VAR 0x0206(0000,202F)] .\\nDime, ¿cómo quieres pagar?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "0206",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000",
            "202F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "F830C296A6D127D8",
      "text": "¿Te parece bien así, entonces?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "F830C396A6D1298B",
      "text": "¿Estás segur[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa? Es parecido a lo que ya tenías.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_02",
      "hash64": "F830C496A6D12B3E",
      "text": "¡Menudo cambio! Te sienta genial.\\n¿Te parece bien así, entonces?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_03",
      "hash64": "F830C596A6D12CF1",
      "text": "Pues me pongo manos a la obra.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_04",
      "hash64": "F830C696A6D12EA4",
      "text": "¿Te lo tienes que pensar más? No te preocupes,\\ntómate el tiempo que necesites.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_05",
      "hash64": "F830C796A6D13057",
      "text": "Uy, ¿entonces prefieres quedarte como estás?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_06",
      "hash64": "F830C896A6D1320A",
      "text": "¡Vale, no te preocupes! Todos cambiamos de\\nparecer. ¡Otra vez será!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_07",
      "hash64": "F830C996A6D133BD",
      "text": "¡Entendido! Tómate el tiempo que necesites,\\nque no hay prisa.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_01_08",
      "hash64": "F830BA96A6D11A40",
      "text": "Bueno, dime, ¿qué te apetece?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "label": "hairsalon_win_02_00",
